        }
      },
      "location": {
        "known": true,
        "value": "Castle Ensis : x1 Somber Smithing Stone [5] can be looted off a corpse. The body can be found lying on the floor of a watchpoint of the bridge. The area is guarded by soldiers and hounds. [ See Shadow of the Erdtree Map ] [ Video Location ]; Shadow Keep : By a tree in the area in which you find the Urcerated Tree Spirit.[ Video Location ]; Enir-Ilim : From the First Rise Site of Grace head up the stairs and once you reach the broken staircase, you'll find this material on a corpse on the left side. The staircase is destroyed, so it leads to a dead-end. [ See Shadow of the Erdtree Map ] [ Video Location ]",
